repository-code: "https://github.com/memQGit/dqc"
url: "https://memq-dqc.readthedocs.io/en/latest/"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for distributed quantum compilation. It takes an input
  circuit and a network topology, partitions the circuit across QPUs,
  reconstructs and emits the distributed circuit as OpenQASM, and builds a
  time execution schedule. Intended as a modular platform for benchmarking
  partitioning algorithms and exploring quantum network configurations.
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - distributed quantum computing
  - quantum compiler
  - circuit partitioning
  - quantum networks
